_model\n    Fix: Update 'smoothed_prompt' assignment to use a known provider/model pair available in PI's model registry\n  • tool_call_summary: deterministic/default\n    Reason: unknown_model\n    Fix: Update 'tool_call_summary' assignment to use a known provider/model pair available in PI's model registry\n  • tool_result_summary: deterministic/default\n    Reason: unknown_model\n    Fix: Update 'tool_result_summary' assignment to use a known provider/model pair available in PI's model registry\n  • turn_rendering: deterministic/default\n    Reason: unknown_model\n    Fix: Update 'turn_rendering' assignment to use a known provider/model pair available in PI's model registry\n  • lower_band_projection: deterministic/default\n    Reason: unknown_model\n    Fix: Update 'lower_band_projection' assignment to use a known provider/model pair available in PI's model registry\n  • chunk_summary_detailed: deterministic/default\n    Reason: unknown_model\n    Fix: Update 'chunk_summary_detailed' assignment to use a known provider/model pair available in PI's model registry\n  • chunk_summary_brief: deterministic/default\n    Reason: unknown_model\n    Fix: Update 'chunk_summary_brief' assignment to use a known provider/model pair available in PI's model registry\n\nCapture will continue, but derivations on these lanes will fail. Update your PI settings or assignment config to resolve.\npi-lhc startup validation: unreachable derivation lanes\n\n  • smoothed_prompt: deterministic/default\n    Reason: unknown_model\n    Fix: Update 'smoothed_prompt' assignment to use a known provider/model pair available in PI's model registry\n  • tool_call_summary: deterministic/default\n    Reason: unknown_model\n    Fix: Update 'tool_call_summary' assignment to use a known provider/model pair available in PI's model registry\n  • tool_result_summary: deterministic/default\n    Reason: unknown_model\n    Fix: Update 'tool_result_summary' assignment to use a known provider/model pair available in PI's model registry\n  • turn_rendering: deterministic/default\n    Reason: unknown_model\n    Fix: Update 'turn_rendering' assignment to use a known provider/model pair available in PI's model registry\n  • lower_band_projection: deterministic/default\n    Reason: unknown_model\n    Fix: Update 'lower_band_projection' assignment to use a known provider/model pair available in PI's model registry\n  • chunk_summary_detailed: deterministic/default\n    Reason: unknown_model\n    Fix: Update 'chunk_summary_detailed' assignment to use a known provider/model pair available in PI's model registry\n  • chunk_summary_brief: deterministic/default\n    Reason: unknown_model\n    Fix: Update 'chunk_summary_brief' assignment to use a known provider/model pair available in PI's model registry\n\nCapture will continue, but derivations on these lanes will fail. Update your PI settings or assignment config to resolve.\npi-lhc startup validation: unreachable derivation lanes\n\n  • smoothed_prompt: deterministic/default\n    Reason: unknown_model\n    Fix: Update 'smoothed_prompt' assignment to use a known provider/model pair available in PI's model registry\n  • tool_call_summary: deterministic/default\n    Reason: unknown_model\n    Fix: Update 'tool_call_summary' assignment to use a known provider/model pair available in PI's model registry\n  • tool_result_summary: deterministic/default\n    Reason: unknown_model\n    Fix: Update 'tool_result_summary' assignment to use a known provider/model pair available in PI's model registry\n  • turn_rendering: deterministic/default\n    Reason: unknown_model\n    Fix: Update 'turn_rendering' assignment to use a known provider/model pair available in PI's model registry\n  • lower_band_projection: deterministic/default\n    Reason: unknown_model\n    Fix: Update 'lower_band_projection' assignment to use a known provider/model pair available in PI's model registry","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":fal